nge  is to work through all of this mess  and translate that into something  meaningful meaningful can mean  visualization so that the visualization  visually the data is summarized in the  proper way  uh it could also mean that we are going  to take  some biological experiment that can be  viewed through multiple different  perspectives and we need to understand  what do all of these perspectives mean  and that means data  integration and also it can mean  we can train some kind of a machine  learning model to  help us understand what happens  in a new data set based on a data set  we've already explored so  we'll talk about all of these components  but i think that all of them are  relevant  for students that are learning about  this or for  practitioners those that are already  using  this kind of data in their
 

